+
+#string STR_MODULE_ABSTRACT
+#language en-US
+"Minimal BDS driver: boots one EFI application from the Firmware Volume"
+
+#string STR_MODULE_DESCRIPTION
+#language en-US
+"FvBootDxe replaces the standard BdsDxe Boot Device Selection driver for "
+"embedded and locked-down products.  It loads and starts the single EFI "
+"application identified by PcdFvBootApplicationGuid from the platform Firmware "
+"Volume, then halts permanently if the application returns.  No boot menu, "
+"no UEFI Shell, no boot option list, no timeout.  The application's integrity "
+"is guaranteed by the platform Root of Trust that signs the Firmware Image "
+"containing this driver; no separate UEFI Secure Boot db key is required."
